TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261206
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261207
SUMMARY:Deadline: Mophradat New Agents 2027: collective curatorial program 
 (USD 6\,000 stipend\, Arab world)
DESCRIPTION:New Agents brings a small group of art practitioners (artists\,
  curators and researchers) together for ten months to co-develop and reali
 se a public event\, such as a conference\, festival or exhibition\, that f
 oregrounds the collective curatorial experience rather than the participan
 ts' individual practices.\n\nOrganisation: Mophradat\nLocation: Online wor
 kshops and seminars (March to June 2027)\, a one-week retreat in Athens (J
 uly 2027) and a public event in Brussels at the end of the program. Applic
 ants must reside within the GMT-1 to GMT+3 time zones and have significant
  firsthand living experience in the Arab world.\nAward: USD 6\,000 stipend
  per participant\, to use at their discretion\, paid 2\,500 / 2\,500 / 1\,
 000. Mophradat also covers retreat travel and a budget for the public even
 t. Number of participants not stated (a small group). No application fee s
 tated.\nDuration: 10 months\, from 1 March 2027\n\nMore: https://mophradat
 .org/program/new-agents/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
URL:https://mophradat.org/program/new-agents/?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online workshops and seminars (March to June 2027)\, a one-week re
 treat in Athens (July 2027) and a public event in Brussels at the end of t
 he program. Applicants must reside within the GMT-1 to GMT+3 time zones an
 d have significant firsthand living experience in the Arab world.
END:VEVENT
